WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:05.510
Un, Deux, Trois, Cat! The dexterity game where you grab cat toys.

2
00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:10.430
Every toy has its own color: yellow bird, green fish, blue ball, and so on.

3
00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:15.480
Cards show every toy in every color. See one in its own color?

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.750
Grab it. No matching colors? Grab the cat.

5
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.380
Here's how a round works:

6
00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:26.710
everybody chants un, deux, trois, cat, and on cat, everybody flips.

7
00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:29.920
Nothing's in its own color, so Gato grabs the cat.

8
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:33.840
A green fish: its own color. I grab it.

9
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:38.820
Two right answers? Each is a point, and I'm fast enough to take both.

10
00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:40.810
Decoys can lure you in.

11
00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:46.590
Gato grabs the wrong color fish and loses a point. The answer was the cat.

12
00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:49.520
Six cat toys and sixty cards.

13
00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:53.580
Two to six players, about ten minutes, most points wins.

14
00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:59.220
Or try the Cat Paw edition: everyone bats the toys with a cat paw on a stick.

15
00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:01.330
Un, Deux, Trois, Cat!

16
00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:05.980
Play it in your browser at darrendon.com, or email me for a prototype.

